  ozelFonksiyon: "tarot ge\xE7mi\u015F sohbeti ba\u015Flat"
  aciklama:
  - "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin i\xE7in \"Kupa Yedilisi\" kart\u0131n\u0131 se\xE7tin {{isim}}.\n\n\xC7ok
    fazla kafa kar\u0131\u015F\u0131kl\u0131\u011F\u0131 ya\u015Fad\u0131\u011F\u0131n
    zamanlar olmu\u015F. Birtak\u0131m olaylar\u0131n senin d\xFC\u015F\xFCnd\xFC\u011F\xFCn
    gibi, tahmin etti\u011Fin sebeple ger\xE7ekle\u015Fip ger\xE7ekle\u015Fmedi\u011Finden
    emin olamam\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n. Baz\u0131 insanlar\u0131n sana kar\u015F\u0131
    as\u0131l niyetlerini tam olarak anlayamam\u0131\u015F, uzun s\xFCreler sorgulam\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n.
    Etraf\u0131n\u0131 saran gri bulutlar\u0131n i\xE7erisinde g\xF6r\xFC\u015F mesafen
    s\u0131f\u0131ra d\xFC\u015Fm\xFC\u015F. Mant\u0131\u011F\u0131n devre d\u0131\u015F\u0131
    kalm\u0131\u015F. \u0130\xE7g\xFCd\xFClerinle ve duygular\u0131nla se\xE7imler
    yapman gerekmi\u015F. Iss\u0131z bir ormanda \xE7emberler \xE7izerek yeniden
    ayn\u0131 noktaya ula\u015Fan bir kedi gibi hissetmi\u015F, mesafe alamad\u0131\u011F\u0131n
    zamanlar \xE7ok bocalam\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n."
